                                                    titleEn: "Svara Sandhi & Four Order Mutations: 1) Savarna Dirgha ($a+a=aa$); 2) Gunadesha ($a/aa + i/ee = e$, $a/aa + u/oo = o$, $a/aa + rhu = ar$; e.g., Rameshwar, Mahotsav, Devarshi); 3) Vriddhyadesha ($a/aa + e/ai = ai$, $a/aa + o/au = au$; e.g., Ekaika, Sadaiva, Jalaugha); 4) Yanadesha ($i/u/rhu + \text{different vowel} \to y/v/r$; e.g., Iti + Aadi = Ityadi, Anu + Aya = Anvaya)",
                                                    chips: ["दीर्घत्व संधी (सूर्यास्त)", "गुणादेश ($इ/उ/ऋ \\to ए, ओ, अर्$)", "वृद्ध्यादेश (एकैक, सदैव)", "यणादेश ($इ/उ \\to य्, व्$ इत्यादी, अन्वय)"]
