                                                    titleEn: "Grammatical Gender Mechanics: Tripartite classification: Pullinga (He/Masculine), Streelinga (She/Feminine), Napunsaklinga (It/Neuter); Unpredictable gender conventions in Marathi; Masculine to feminine derivations (-ee, -in, -oo suffixes); Dual/Tri-gender invariant words (Ubhaylingi): 'Por' (functions in all 3 genders), 'Mool' (Masculine & Neuter), 'Vel' (Masculine & Feminine), 'Mahal'",
