                                                    titleEn: "SD Invariance Properties & Coefficient of Variation (CV): 1) SD is independent of change of origin (adding/subtracting constant $k$ leaves $\sigma$ unchanged), but dependent on change of scale (multiplying/dividing by $k$ scales $\sigma$ by $|k|$); 2) Coefficient of Variation: Dimensionless metric of relative variability: $CV = \left(\frac{\sigma}{\bar{x}}\right) \times 100\%$; The series/player exhibiting LOWER CV is deemed MORE CONSISTENT and stable",
