                                                    titleEn: "Landmark Supreme Court Constitution Bench Rulings: 1) Electoral Bonds Scheme Quashed (Feb 2024): 5-judge bench headed by CJI D.Y. Chandrachud unanimously declared the 2018 Electoral Bonds scheme unconstitutional, ruling that anonymous corporate donations violate citizens' Right to Information under Article 19(1)(a); 2) Abrogation of Article 370 Upheld (Dec 2023): Unanimously upheld the constitutional validity of the Union's decision abrogating J&K's special status, ordering restoration of statehood and assembly elections",
