                                                    titleEn: "Criminal Codes & Election Commission Act: 1) Tripartite Criminal Law Overhaul (Enforced 1 July 2024): Replaced IPC 1860 with Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita (BNS, 358 sections), CrPC 1973 with Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita (BNSS, 531 sections), and Evidence Act 1872 with Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam (BSA, 170 sections); Mandated electronic summons, zero FIRs, and forensic audits; 2) CEC & Other ECs (Appointment & Conditions of Service) Act 2023: Established Selection Committee comprising PM, a designated Union Cabinet Minister, and Leader of Opposition in Lok Sabha",
