                                                    titleEn: "Gaganyaan & Sovereign AI/Quantum Compute: 1) Gaganyaan: India's premier human spaceflight mission aiming to send 3 crew members to 400 km LEO for 3 days; Precursor uncrewed flights deploy female humanoid robot 'Vyommitra'; 2) IndiaAI Mission (Approved March 2024 with Rs 10,372 Cr outlay): Establishes sovereign AI infrastructure with >10,000 GPU compute capacity to nurture indigenous AI startups and foundation models; 3) National Quantum Mission (NQM funded at Rs 6,003 Cr)",
