                                                    titleEn: "NTFP Economy & Forest Rights Act 2006: 1) Non-Timber Forest Produce (NTFP): Economic backbone of tribal livelihood in Vidarbha; Tendu leaves (bidi rolling), Bamboo (Ballarpur paper mills, handicrafts), Lac, Honey, Hirda; 2) Forest Rights Act 2006 (FRA): Vested individual land titles and Community Forest Rights (CFR) in Gram Sabhas; Mendha-Lekha in Gadchiroli became India's 1st village to secure community rights over bamboo and forest governance",
