                                                    titleEn: "WPI vs CPI Comparison & Flexible Inflation Targeting (FIT): 1) WPI: Formulated by DPIIT, Ministry of Commerce; Base Year 2011-12; 697 items; Measures wholesale stage for GOODS ONLY (Zero services); Heaviest weighting: Manufactured Products (64.2%); 2) CPI-Combined: Published by NSO (MoSPI); Base Year 2012; Tracks retail consumption of GOODS AND SERVICES; Heaviest weighting: Food and Beverages (45.86%); 3) Policy Anchor: Following Urjit Patel Committee (2014), RBI formally abandoned WPI, anchoring monetary policy strictly to CPI-Combined headline inflation",
                                                    chips: ["WPI घाऊक निर्देशांक (DPIIT २०११-१२, सेवांचा समावेश नाही)", "CPI ग्राहक निर्देशांक (NSO २०१२, वस्तू व सेवा)", "CPI मध्ये अन्नाचा भार ४५.८६%", "RBI महागाई मोजण्यासाठी CPI वापरते"]
