                                                    titleEn: "Artificial Intelligence & Sovereign Compute (IndiaAI Mission): 1) AI Evolution: Machine simulation of human cognitive intelligence; Coined by John McCarthy (1956 Dartmouth Conference); Branches: Machine Learning, Deep Neural Networks, Natural Language Processing (NLP), and Generative AI (LLMs); 2) IndiaAI Mission: Approved by Union Cabinet with Rs 10,372 Cr outlay; Anchors creation of public-private compute infrastructure housing >10,000 GPUs, fostering indigenous foundation models trained on Indian multilingual corpora",
