                                                    titleEn: "Operating System Functions & Kernel-Shell Architecture: 1) System Software interfacing human users and bare-metal hardware; 2) Modular Layers: Kernel (Core program residing permanently in RAM managing CPU, memory, and devices) and Shell (Command interpreter translating user commands to Kernel); 3) Primary Subsystems: Process scheduling, Memory paging/swapping, File systems (FAT32, NTFS, ext4), Device driver handling, and Access control security; 4) Modes: Single-user (MS-DOS), Multi-user (UNIX, Linux), Multi-tasking (Windows, macOS), Real-Time Operating Systems (RTOS for embedded missions)",
                                                    chips: ["ऑपरेटिंग सिस्टीम (सिस्टीम सॉफ्टवेअर)", "कर्नल Kernel (OS चा मुख्य गाभा)", "शेल Shell (कमांड इंटरप्रिटर)", "मल्टी-टास्किंग व रिअल-टाइम OS"]
