                                                    titleEn: "Maharashtra's Aaple Sarkar & State E-Governance Architecture: 1) Aaple Sarkar Web Portal: Maharashtra's flagship e-governance service gateway implementing the Right to Public Services Act 2015; Offers >500 citizen-centric services digitally; Dispatches digitally signed verifications (Caste, Income, Domicile, Non-Creamy Layer, 7/12 Land Records) with QR authentication; 2) MahaDBT: Consolidated state direct benefit transfer portal channelling educational scholarships and agrarian subsidies directly into Aadhaar-linked citizen accounts",
                                                    chips: ["आपले सरकार पोर्टल (५००+ ऑनलाइन सेवा)", "डिजिटल स्वाक्षरीचे दाखले (जात, उत्पन्न, ७/१२)", "MahaDBT पोर्टल (थेट शिष्यवृत्ती बँक जमा)", "पारदर्शक ई-प्रशासन"]
